@startuml sd-unicorns
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber
title SD - GET /api/v2/unicorns (aircraft mood): a pure CQRS query

participant "Aircraft / FO\nevents" as EV
box "Any FO replica" #F4FFF4
participant "MoodProjector" as MP
database "query schema\naircraft_mood_view" as DB
participant "UnicornController" as UC
end box
participant "API Gateway" as GW
actor "User / Postman" as U
participant "Postman mock server\n(contract)" as Mock

== Write path: no command exists for the mood ==
EV -> MP : AircraftRegistered / AircraftStatusChanged /\nFlightScheduled / FlightStatusChanged / FlightReassigned
MP -> MP : recompute mood of the affected aircraft
note right
  SLEEPING : aircraft not ACTIVE
  GRUMPY   : >= 2 flights DELAYED or CANCELED in the last 7 days
  BUSY     : >= 3 flights in the next 24 h
  HAPPY    : otherwise
end note
MP -> DB : UPSERT aircraft_mood_view (mood, reason, counters, updatedAt)

== Read path ==
U -> GW : GET /api/v2/unicorns  (Bearer JWT)
GW -> UC : routed to FO (round-robin)
UC -> DB : SELECT * FROM aircraft_mood_view
UC --> GW : 200 [{registrationNumber, mood, reason,\ndelayedOrCanceledLast7Days, flightsNext24h, updatedAt}]
GW --> U : 200 application/json

== Contract test in Postman ==
U -> Mock : GET {{mockUrl}}/api/v2/unicorns
Mock --> U : example response (same JSON schema)
U -> U : the same schema test runs against the mock and the real endpoint

note over EV, Mock
  CQRS: the mood is never written by a client; it is a read model derived from events.
  v2: a new projection exposed without changing the v1 contract (URI versioning).
end note
@enduml
